            <p class="text-xs text-blue-700 mb-2">In <code>cready-viewer.js</code> (or cready-viewer.html), after successful enroll POST and after attestation POST, add PostHog captures:</p>
            <pre class="bg-blue-100 rounded p-2 text-xs overflow-x-auto mt-1 text-blue-900">// On successful enroll:
